@startuml
' Source: ../apollo-timer-architecture.drawio (page 08d-uboot-delay-sequence)
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK KR
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #235D86
  ParticipantFontColor #172C43
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ArrowColor #235D86
  ArrowFontColor #172C43
  MessageAlign center
  ParticipantPadding 10
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
scale max 790 width

participant "Firmware caller" as p0
participant "Common udelay" as p1
participant "ARMv8 __udelay" as p2
participant "CPU Counter / Event" as p3

p0 -> p1 : 1. udelay(usec)
p1 -> p1 : 2. schedule() · 대기 구간 분할
p1 -> p2 : 3. __udelay(kv) · UTHREAD 비활성 경로
p2 -> p3 : 4. CNTPCT + usec_to_tick() → target
p2 -> p3 : 5. [옵션 활성 / EL2+] CNTHCTL 저장 · event enable
p2 -> p3 : 6. [남은 구간 충분] WFE / count 재확인
p2 -> p3 : 7. CNTHCTL 복원 → 마지막 구간 polling
p2 -> p0 : 8. count > target이면 반환 · 남은 분할 구간 반복

@enduml
